rl":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOUndpR1NNc2w2VnZXSmNzRGJTUkkyVnc5WXI0eUhJNUx3SnNYQ2NmUTZUQkxxZzVCemI0STJwOHFHdkJGc2NXeGJHZ2lSeFJUZWNISG4ydW1lWFdzNUktd243aER2TkVZTlVTSXN6UlRBblFMUE9YQm1SQTRwYUE0N3NFRXZaTGJZRzIweGJ4SU9lNkdFMWNkeUEyaEk?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"百特國際 (Baxter International) 的每股盈餘和收入超過 2026 年第三季度，並提高了指引"},{"title":"Why Is Baxter Stock Trading Lower on Thursday?","src":"Benzinga","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPbWhqSVZtWUl0RmNxQnpWeWxJZVhXakZUaWFYNk90aHFhcGRESkpYZC1jbzFSek9jNHRpT3h4TFV1OThmUHhDX3RQOWtJMkVsVWpoZWZnbjZxekFWdkF2ejRTVjdNNjN2TWZfSV80VXJmUFZ3eW9DUUxrcjVwS3J5c3BhamFQNWxmTmtrNzVTbm82RXY2cnVXdlBxS096YTQ4TS1Mbw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"為什麼百特股票週四交易走低？"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":8},{"name":"減重藥/生技","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/10456/000162828026007733/bax-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Baxter International Inc., through our subsidiaries, provides a broad portfolio of essential healthcare products, including sterile intravenous (IV) solutions; infusion systems and devices; parenteral nutrition therapies; inhaled anesthetics; generic injectable pharmaceuticals; surgical hemostat and sealant products; advanced surgical equipment; smart bed systems; patient monitoring and diagnostic technologies; and respiratory health devices. These products are used by hospitals, nursing homes, rehabilitation centers, ambulatory surgery centers, doctors' offices, kidney dialysis centers and patients at home under physician supervision. Our global footprint and the critical nature of our products and services play a key role in expanding access to healthcare in emerging and developed countries. As of December 31, 2025, after giving effect to the sale of our Kidney Care business (as discus","zh":null},{"en":"Baxter International Inc. was incorporated under Delaware law in 1931. As used in this report, \"we\", \"our\" or \"us\" means Baxter International Inc. and its consolidated subsidiaries, unless the context otherwise requires.","zh":null},{"en":"On August 12, 2024, we entered into an Equity Purchase Agreement (EPA) with certain affiliates of Carlyle Group Inc. (Carlyle) to sell our Kidney Care business. That business, which is now known as Vantive Health LLC (Vantive) is comprised of our former Kidney Care segment. On January 31, 2025, we completed the sale of our Kidney Care business to Carlyle for an aggregate purchase price of $3.80 billion in cash, subject to certain closing cash, working capital and debt adjustments. After giving effect to certain adjustments, we received approximately $3.71 billion pre-tax cash proceeds at closing of the transaction with the net after tax proceeds of approximately $3.3 billion, prior to giving effects to certain post-closing adjustments. As of December 31, 2025, we repaid $3.81 billion of legacy indebtedness in 2025 (which repayment does not include $2.00 billion of indebtedness repaid wit","zh":null}],"markets":[{"en":"We currently manage our global operations based on three reportable segments: Medical Products & Therapies, Healthcare Systems & Technologies and Pharmaceuticals.","zh":null},{"en":"The Medical Products & Therapies segment includes sales of our sterile IV solutions, infusion systems, administration sets, parenteral nutrition therapies and surgical hemostat, sealant and adhesion prevention products. The Healthcare Systems & Technologies segment includes sales of our connected care solutions and collaboration tools, including smart bed systems, patient monitoring systems and diagnostic technologies, respiratory health devices and advanced equipment for the surgical space, including operating room integration technologies, precision positioning devices and other accessories. The Pharmaceuticals segment includes sales of specialty injectable pharmaceuticals, inhaled anesthetics and drug compounding services.","zh":null}],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Medical Products & Therapies","val":5299000000,"zh":"Medical Products & Therapies"},{"name":"Healthcare Systems & Technologies","val":3071000000,"zh":"Healthcare Systems & Technologies"},{"name":"Pharmaceuticals","val":2493000000,"zh":"Pharmaceuticals"}],"total":11244000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":6122000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":5122000000,"zh":"Non Us"},{"name":"Western Europe Canada Japan Australia & New Zealand","val":3728000000,"zh":"Western Europe Canada Japan Australia & New Zealand"},{"name":"Eastern Europe Middle East Africa Latin America Asia","val":1394000000,"zh":"Eastern Europe Middle East Africa Latin America Asia"}],"total":11244000000}},"peers":["BDX","EW","CAH","BSX","SYK"]}}